10 REM D-PLAYQUEUE gate: PLAY appends, blocks when the ring is full, syncs voices at
11 REM each PLAY's end, and BEEP resets the settings. Totals within a few jiffies (the
12 REM reference's PLAY starts a little later, D-PLAYRATE); the spacing of the
13 REM block points (one bar each) exact.
20 DIM T(12):TIME=0
30 FOR B=1 TO 12:PLAY "T120O4L8EDCDEEE4":T(B)=TIME:NEXT
